{"obsah":"<p>If you're looking for a chance to level up your bike skills, you'll love our 2 camps for men and women. The season is approaching, so it's time to prepare properly. You'll practise everything from the basic stance and correct braking, balance and the pump track to riding over obstacles, drops and benches. </p>\n\n<p>The camps are suitable for off-road beginners as well as intermediate riders, with groups split according to goals, motivation and ability if needed.</p>\n\n<p>You can sign up for these camps.</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<p><strong>Women Tune Up with Bikeskills camps: </strong></p>\n\n<p>15/04 Sat - <a href=\"https://bikeskills.cz/en/events/women-tune-up-with-bikeskills-1-2023\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">https://bikeskills.cz/en/events/women-tune-up-with-bikeskills-1-2023 </a></p>\n\n<p>30/04 Sun - <a href=\"https://bikeskills.cz/en/events/women-tune-up-with-bikeskills-2-2023\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">https://bikeskills.cz/en/events/women-tune-up-with-bikeskills-2-2023</a></p>\n\n<p><strong>Men Tune Up with Bikeskills camps:</strong></p>\n\n<p>16/04 Sun - <a href=\"https://bikeskills.cz/en/events/men-tune-up-with-bikeskills-1-2023\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">https://bikeskills.cz/en/events/men-tune-up-with-bikeskills-1-2023</a></p>\n\n<p>29/04 Sat - <a href=\"https://bikeskills.cz/en/events/men-tune-up-with-bikeskills-2-2023\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">https://bikeskills.cz/en/events/men-tune-up-with-bikeskills-2-2023</a></p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F03%2F20220528_115418039-kopie.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F03%2F20220528_115418039